"""Servidor HTTP concorrente; transações serializam mudanças no estado."""
import argparse
import hmac
import json
import re
from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer
from urllib.parse import parse_qs, urlsplit

from .classes import Classes, filtered
from .attendance import Attendance
from .domain import Academia, Error, norm, require
from .store import ROOT, Store


def public(method, path, query):
    if method == 'POST':
        return path == '/api/mensagens'
    if method != 'GET':
        return False
    return (path in ('/', '/equipe', '/api/saude', '/api/planos', '/api/modalidades',
                     '/api/exercicios', '/api/avaliacoes/horarios')
            or path.startswith('/exercicios/') or path.startswith('/api/exercicios/')
            or (path == '/api/aulas' and 'data' in query and 'de' not in query and 'ate' not in query))


def route(app, method, path, query, body):
    store = app.store
    if method == 'GET' and path == '/api/saude':
        return 200, {'ok': True, 'versao': (ROOT / 'VERSION').read_text().strip()}
    classes = Classes(app)
    attendance = Attendance(app)
    if path == '/api/checkins':
        if method == 'POST':
            return attendance.checkin(body)
        if method == 'GET':
            return 200, {'checkins': attendance.listing(query)}
    if path == '/api/tarefas/rodar' and method == 'POST':
        return 200, attendance.run(body)
    if path == '/api/aulas' and method == 'GET':
        return 200, {'aulas': classes.occurrences(query)}
    if path == '/api/reservas':
        if method == 'POST':
            return 201, classes.reserve(body)
        if method == 'GET':
            return 200, {'reservas': classes.reservations(query)}
    match = re.fullmatch(r'/api/reservas/(\d+)/(cancelar|presenca)', path)
    if match and method == 'POST':
        return 200, classes.change(int(match[1]), match[2], body)
    match = re.fullmatch(r'/api/aulas/([\w-]+)/ocorrencias/([0-9-]+)/cancelar', path)
    if match and method == 'POST':
        return 200, classes.cancel_occurrence(match[1], match[2], body)
    if path == '/api/espera':
        if method == 'POST':
            return 201, classes.wait(body)
        if method == 'GET':
            return 200, {'espera': filtered(store.all('espera'), query)}
    if path == '/api/saida' and method == 'GET':
        return 200, {'mensagens': store.all('saida')}
    if path == '/api/alunos':
        if method == 'POST':
            status, aluno = app.aluno(body)
            return status, {k: aluno[k] for k in ('id', 'codigo')}
        if method == 'GET':
            search = norm(query.get('busca', [''])[0])
            digits = re.sub(r'\D', '', search)
            items = [a for a in store.all('alunos') if not search or search in norm(a['nome'])
                     or (digits and digits in (a['telefone'] or '')) or search == a['codigo']]
            return 200, {'alunos': items}
    match = re.fullmatch(r'/api/alunos/(\d+)(?:/(matriculas))?', path)
    if match:
        identifier = int(match[1])
        app.get('alunos', identifier)
        if method == 'PUT' and not match[2]:
            return app.aluno(body, identifier)
        if method == 'GET' and match[2] == 'matriculas':
            return 200, {'matriculas': [app.matricula_view(m) for m in store.all('matriculas') if m['aluno_id'] == identifier]}
    if path == '/api/matriculas' and method == 'POST':
        return 201, app.matricular(body)
    match = re.fullmatch(r'/api/matriculas/(\d+)/(pagamento|trancar|destrancar|cancelar)', path)
    if match and method == 'POST':
        return 200, app.mudar_matricula(int(match[1]), match[2], body)
    if path == '/api/modalidades' and method == 'GET':
        return 200, {'modalidades': store.all('modalidades')}
    match = re.fullmatch(r'/api/planos(?:/([\w-]+))?', path)
    if match:
        identifier = match[1]
        if method == 'GET' and identifier is None:
            return 200, {'planos': [p for p in store.all('planos') if p['ativo']]}
        if method == 'POST' and identifier is None:
            require(body, {'id': str, 'nome': str, 'vigencia_dias': int})
            if store.get('planos', body['id']):
                raise Error(409, 'id_duplicado')
            item = dict(id=body['id'], ativo=True, aulas=None)
        elif identifier is not None and method in ('PUT', 'DELETE'):
            item = app.get('planos', identifier)
            if method == 'DELETE':
                item['ativo'] = False
                store.save('planos', item)
                return 200, {'ativo': False}
        else:
            raise Error(404, 'rota_inexistente')
        require(body, {k: t for k, t in {'nome': str, 'vigencia_dias': int, 'ativo': bool}.items() if k in body})
        item.update({k: v for k, v in body.items() if k in ('nome', 'preco', 'vigencia_dias', 'aulas', 'ativo')})
        if type(item.get('preco')) not in (int, float) or item['preco'] < 0:
            raise Error(400, 'preco_invalido')
        if item['vigencia_dias'] <= 0 or (item['aulas'] is not None and (type(item['aulas']) is not int or item['aulas'] <= 0)):
            raise Error(422, 'plano_invalido')
        store.save('planos', item)
        return (201 if method == 'POST' else 200), item
    raise Error(404, 'rota_inexistente')


def handler(app):
    class Handler(BaseHTTPRequestHandler):
        def respond(self, status, value):
            data = json.dumps(value, ensure_ascii=False).encode('utf-8')
            self.send_response(status)
            self.send_header('Content-Type', 'application/json; charset=utf-8')
            self.send_header('Content-Length', str(len(data)))
            self.end_headers()
            self.wfile.write(data)

        def dispatch(self):
            try:
                parts = urlsplit(self.path)
                query = parse_qs(parts.query)
                if not public(self.command, parts.path, query):
                    expected = str(app.store.config['token']).encode()
                    actual = self.headers.get('X-Token', '').encode()
                    if not actual or not hmac.compare_digest(actual, expected):
                        raise Error(401, 'nao_autorizado')
                length = int(self.headers.get('Content-Length', '0'))
                if not 0 <= length <= 1048576:
                    raise Error(400, 'corpo_grande')
                body = json.loads(self.rfile.read(length)) if length else {}
                if not isinstance(body, dict):
                    raise Error(400, 'objeto_json_obrigatorio')
                with app.store.lock, app.store.db:
                    status, result = route(app, self.command, parts.path, query, body)
                self.respond(status, result)
            except Error as exc:
                self.respond(exc.status, {'motivo': exc.motivo})
            except (ValueError, TypeError):
                self.respond(400, {'motivo': 'entrada_invalida'})

        do_GET = do_POST = do_PUT = do_DELETE = dispatch

        def log_message(self, *args):
            pass
    return Handler


def main():
    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description='Atendimento ao aluno de academia')
    commands = parser.add_subparsers(dest='command', required=True)
    serve = commands.add_parser('serve')
    serve.add_argument('--porta', type=int, default=8080)
    serve.add_argument('--host', default='127.0.0.1')
    serve.add_argument('--dados', required=True)
    args = parser.parse_args()
    app = Academia(Store(args.dados))
    server = ThreadingHTTPServer((args.host, args.porta), handler(app))
    print(f'PORTA={server.server_address[1]}', flush=True)
    try:
        server.serve_forever()
    finally:
        server.server_close()
        app.store.db.close()
"""Persistência transacional; cada entidade é um documento JSON no SQLite."""
import json
import shutil
import sqlite3
import threading
from pathlib import Path

ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent
CATALOGOS = ('modalidades', 'professores', 'salas', 'planos', 'grade', 'exercicios', 'faq')


class Store:
    def __init__(self, directory):
        directory = Path(directory)
        directory.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
        config = directory / 'academia.json'
        if not config.exists():
            shutil.copyfile(ROOT / 'exemplos/academia.json', config)
        self.config = json.loads(config.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
        self.lock = threading.RLock()
        self.db = sqlite3.connect(directory / 'academia.sqlite3', check_same_thread=False)
        self.db.execute('PRAGMA journal_mode=WAL')
        self.db.execute('CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS registros (colecao TEXT, id TEXT, documento TEXT NOT NULL, PRIMARY KEY (colecao, id))')
        self.db.execute('CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS metadados (chave TEXT PRIMARY KEY, valor TEXT)')
        with self.db:
            if not self.db.execute("SELECT 1 FROM metadados WHERE chave='semeado'").fetchone():
                for collection in CATALOGOS:
                    for original in self.config.get(collection, []):
                        item = dict(original)
                        if collection in ('professores', 'planos', 'grade', 'exercicios'):
                            item.setdefault('ativo', True)
                        if collection == 'planos':
                            item.setdefault('aulas', None)
                        self.save(collection, item)
                self.db.execute("INSERT INTO metadados VALUES ('semeado', '1')")

    def all(self, collection):
        return [json.loads(row[0]) for row in self.db.execute(
            'SELECT documento FROM registros WHERE colecao=? ORDER BY rowid', (collection,))]

    def get(self, collection, identifier):
        row = self.db.execute('SELECT documento FROM registros WHERE colecao=? AND id=?',
                              (collection, str(identifier))).fetchone()
        return json.loads(row[0]) if row else None

    def save(self, collection, item):
        self.db.execute('INSERT INTO registros VALUES (?, ?, ?) ON CONFLICT(colecao,id) DO UPDATE SET documento=excluded.documento',
                        (collection, str(item['id']), json.dumps(item, ensure_ascii=False)))
        return item

    def next_id(self, collection):
        key = 'sequencia:' + collection
        row = self.db.execute('SELECT valor FROM metadados WHERE chave=?', (key,)).fetchone()
        value = int(row[0]) + 1 if row else 1
        self.db.execute('INSERT INTO metadados VALUES (?, ?) ON CONFLICT(chave) DO UPDATE SET valor=excluded.valor', (key, str(value)))
        return value
"""Seções 6 e 7.3: biblioteca de exercícios, ficha do aluno, "meu treino de hoje", explicação pelo chat."""
from conftest import Servidor, norm

IDS = ["agachamento", "flexao", "prancha", "remada", "supino", "terra-bastao", "afundo", "elevacao-pelvica",
       "abdominal", "desenvolvimento", "puxada", "polichinelo"]

FICHA = {"treinos": [
    {"nome": "A", "itens": [{"exercicio": "agachamento", "series": 3, "repeticoes": 12, "carga": "20 kg", "descanso_s": 60},
                            {"exercicio": "prancha", "series": 3, "repeticoes": 30}]},
    {"nome": "B", "itens": [{"exercicio": "flexao", "series": 3, "repeticoes": 10}]},
]}


def test_biblioteca_lista_e_404(api):
    st, r = api.get("/api/exercicios", token=None)
    assert st == 200 and [e["id"] for e in r["exercicios"]] == IDS
    st, e = api.get("/api/exercicios/prancha", token=None)
    assert st == 200
    assert (e["nome"], e["grupo"], len(e["passos"]), e["svg"], e["ativo"]) == ("Prancha", "core", 3, True, True)
    assert "plank" in e["apelidos"] and e["erros_comuns"] and e["cuidados"]
    assert api.get("/api/exercicios/xyz", token=None)[0] == 404


def test_ficha_montar_e_ler(api):
    aid = api.aluno()
    st, r = api.put(f"/api/alunos/{aid}/ficha", FICHA)
    assert st == 200 and [t["nome"] for t in r["treinos"]] == ["A", "B"]
    st, r = api.get(f"/api/alunos/{aid}/ficha")
    assert st == 200 and r["treinos"][0]["itens"][0]["carga"] == "20 kg" and r["treinos"][1]["itens"][0]["series"] == 3
    assert api.put(f"/api/alunos/{aid}/ficha", {"treinos": [{"nome": "C", "itens": [{"exercicio": "xyz", "series": 3, "repeticoes": 10}]}]})[0] == 422
    assert api.put("/api/alunos/9999/ficha", FICHA)[0] == 404
    assert api.get("/api/alunos/9999/ficha")[0] == 404
    assert api.delete(f"/api/alunos/{aid}/ficha")[0] == 204
    assert api.get(f"/api/alunos/{aid}/ficha")[0] == 404


def test_meu_treino_pelo_chat_rotaciona(dados):
    s = Servidor(dados, agora="2026-10-05T10:00")
    api = s.subir()
    aid = api.ativo("Maria", "41988887777", inicio="2026-10-01")
    api.put(f"/api/alunos/{aid}/ficha", FICHA)
    cod = api.codigo(aid)
    r = api.msg("41988887777", "meu treino de hoje")
    assert r.splitlines()[0] == "Treino A"
    assert "- Agachamento: 3x12, 20 kg, descanso 60 s" in r and "- Prancha: 3x30" in r
    assert "explica" in norm(r)
    api.checkin(cod)
    assert api.msg("41988887777", "qual meu treino?").splitlines()[0] == "Treino A"   # check-in de hoje não conta
    s.parar()
    s2 = Servidor(dados)                                   # 06/10: 1 check-in em dia anterior → B
    api = s2.subir()
    r = api.msg("41988887777", "meu treino")
    assert r.splitlines()[0] == "Treino B" and "- Flexão de braço: 3x10" in r
    api.checkin(cod)
    s2.parar()
    s3 = Servidor(dados, agora="2026-10-07T10:00")        # 2 check-ins anteriores → 2 mod 2 = 0 → A
    api = s3.subir()
    assert api.msg("41988887777", "treino de hoje").splitlines()[0] == "Treino A"
    s3.parar()


def test_meu_treino_sem_ficha_ou_sem_plano(api):
    api.ativo("Com plano", "41999990001")
    r = norm(api.msg("41999990001", "meu treino"))
    assert "ficha" in r and "professor" in r
    api.aluno("Sem plano", "41999990002")
    r = norm(api.msg("41999990002", "qual a minha ficha"))
    assert "plano" in r and "recepcao" in r


def test_explicar_exercicio_pelo_chat(api):
    r = api.msg("41988887777", "como faço a prancha?")
    linhas = r.splitlines()
    assert linhas[0] == "Prancha"
    assert "1. Antebraços no chão, cotovelos abaixo dos ombros." in r and "2. " in r and "3. " in r
    assert "Cuidado: Dor na lombar: pare e avise o professor." in r
    assert linhas[-1] == "Veja a animação: /exercicios/prancha"
    assert api.msg("41988887777", "me mostra o push-up").splitlines()[0] == "Flexão de braço"
    assert api.msg("41988887777", "explica o levantamento terra").splitlines()[0] == "Levantamento terra com bastão"
    assert api.get("/api/atendimento-humano")[1]["fila"] == []


def test_exercicio_novo_sem_svg(api):
    novo = {"id": "rosca", "nome": "Rosca direta", "apelidos": ["rosca", "biceps"], "grupo": "bracos",
            "passos": ["Segure os halteres com as palmas para a frente.", "Dobre os cotovelos sem mover os ombros."],
            "cuidados": ["Não balance o tronco."]}
    st, r = api.post("/api/exercicios", novo)
    assert st == 201, r
    assert api.post("/api/exercicios", novo)[0] == 409
    assert api.post("/api/exercicios", {"id": "vazio", "nome": "Vazio", "passos": []})[0] == 422
    lista = api.get("/api/exercicios", token=None)[1]["exercicios"]
    assert lista[-1]["id"] == "rosca" and lista[-1]["svg"] is False
    r = api.msg("41988887777", "como faz a rosca?")
    assert r.splitlines()[0] == "Rosca direta" and "1. Segure os halteres" in r and "Veja a animação" not in r
    st, html = api.get("/exercicios/rosca", token=None)
    assert st == 200 and "Rosca direta" in html and ".svg" not in html
    assert api.get("/exercicios/rosca.svg", token=None)[0] == 404

